---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, withBase } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Euro Desk FX privacy note: static site on GitHub Pages, no invasive tracking, links to Telegram and X."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
    <p class="label-micro">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="headline-md mt-3" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-blog mt-10">
      <p>
        <strong>{SITE.name}</strong> runs a static site on GitHub Pages. Personal data is not sold, and
        this page does not ask you to register.
      </p>
      <h2>What data is handled?</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>On this website:</strong> the host (GitHub Pages) may keep standard technical logs
          (IP, user-agent) under GitHub’s policies.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email signup (optional):</strong> if you submit the tips form, your name, email,
          consent, and a source tag (techonni.com · Euro Desk FX) are stored in a private Google Sheet
          controlled by the site owner so you can receive occasional beginner FX tips. You can ask to
          be removed any time. This is separate from Telegram or X.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Telegram / X:</strong> when you use those apps, their own privacy policies apply.
          Those platforms are separate processors.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        By default this static site does not add marketing cookies or third-party tracking pixels. If
        simple aggregate stats are added later, this page will be updated.
      </p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        Links go to Telegram ({SITE.telegram}) and X ({SITE.x}). After you leave this domain, those
        services’ rules apply.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about this site, use the public channels above. Never send passwords, seed
        phrases, KYC files, or deposits in the name of Euro Desk FX — treat any such request as a scam.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12 font-legal text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-soft">
      Educational content only. This is not financial advice.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-8">
      <a href={withBase('/')} class="link-arrow">← Back home</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
